{"book":"kinney","chapter":"tailwind","chapterTitle":"Tailwind CSS","slug":"group-and-peer-modifiers","title":"معدِّلات group وpeer","headings":[{"depth":2,"id":"تنسيق-حالة-العنصر-الأب","text":"تنسيق حالة العنصر الأب"},{"depth":3,"id":"مثال-عملي-بطاقة-تفاعلية","text":"مثال عملي: بطاقة تفاعلية"},{"depth":3,"id":"ميزات-group-المتقدمة","text":"ميزات group المتقدمة"},{"depth":3,"id":"نمط-الحاوية-الذكية","text":"نمط الحاوية الذكية"},{"depth":2,"id":"تنسيق-حالة-العنصر-الشقيق","text":"تنسيق حالة العنصر الشقيق"},{"depth":3,"id":"نمط-التسمية-العائمة","text":"نمط التسمية العائمة"},{"depth":3,"id":"ميزات-peer-المتقدمة","text":"ميزات peer المتقدمة"},{"depth":2,"id":"المزالق-الشائعة-وحلولها","text":"المزالق الشائعة وحلولها"},{"depth":3,"id":"مشكلة-تعدد-الأقران","text":"مشكلة تعدد الأقران"},{"depth":3,"id":"تعارضات-المجموعات-المتعششة","text":"تعارضات المجموعات المتعشّشة"},{"depth":2,"id":"إظهار-المحتوى-المشروط","text":"إظهار المحتوى المشروط"},{"depth":2,"id":"الفروق-الأساسية","text":"الفروق الأساسية"}],"html":"<p>معدِّلا <code>group</code> و<code>peer</code> من أقوى ميزات Tailwind لإنشاء مكوّنات تفاعلية دون كتابة CSS مخصص. يتيحان لك تنسيق العناصر بناءً على حالة العناصر الأب (<code>group</code>) أو الأشقاء (<code>peer</code>).</p>\n<h2 id=\"تنسيق-حالة-العنصر-الأب\">تنسيق حالة العنصر الأب</h2>\n<p>تتيح لك معدِّلات <code>group</code> تنسيق العناصر الابنة عندما تتغيّر حالة عنصر أب. تضيف group إلى عنصر أب، ثم تستخدم <code>group-hover:</code> و<code>group-focus:</code> وما شابه على العناصر الابنة.</p>\n<p>طبّق صنف <code>group</code> على عنصر أب، ثم استخدم صيغ <code>group-*</code> على العناصر السليلة:</p>\n<p><em>تنسيق حالة العنصر الأب — المثال 1 — <a href=\"https://stevekinney.com/generated/playgrounds/6450343962365f6e955f5c00829c0dcee3453c21ffbb0c9445e0086776013ab1.html\">افتح المثال</a></em></p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-html\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;group&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">h3</span>&gt;</span>Parent<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">h3</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;group-hover:text-blue-500&quot;</span>&gt;</span>Changes when parent is hovered<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span>&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>&gt;</span>\n</code></pre>\n<p>من حالات الاستخدام المثالية:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>تأثيرات تمرير متعددة العناصر على البطاقات</li>\n<li>عناصر تنقل بأيقونات ونص</li>\n<li>تفاعلات أزرار معقدة</li>\n<li>عناصر قائمة تفاعلية</li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>يمكنك دمج المعدِّلات مع الصيغ.</strong></p>\n<p>يعمل مع كل الأصناف الزائفة: <code>group-focus</code> و<code>group-active</code> و<code>group-odd</code>.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"مثال-عملي-بطاقة-تفاعلية\">مثال عملي: بطاقة تفاعلية</h3>\n<p><em>مثال عملي: بطاقة تفاعلية — المثال 2 — <a href=\"https://stevekinney.com/generated/playgrounds/dde935d0de16b37d211cae08b41c00bffd2429f5b3fdcb873dda32feac9569d7.html\">افتح المثال</a></em></p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-html\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;group rounded-lg bg-white p-6 shadow-md transition-shadow hover:shadow-xl&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">h3</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;mb-2 text-lg font-semibold transition-colors group-hover:text-blue-600&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n    Product Card\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">h3</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;mb-4 text-gray-600 transition-colors group-hover:text-gray-800&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n    A fantastic product description.\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">button</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;rounded bg-blue-500 px-4 py-2 text-white transition-all group-hover:scale-105 group-hover:bg-blue-600&quot;</span>\n  &gt;</span>\n    Buy Now\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">button</span>&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>&gt;</span>\n</code></pre>\n<h3 id=\"ميزات-group-المتقدمة\">ميزات group المتقدمة</h3>\n<p><strong><code>group-has-*</code></strong> - التنسيق بناءً على حالة العنصر السليل:</p>\n<p><em>ميزات group المتقدمة — المثال 3 — <a href=\"https://stevekinney.com/generated/playgrounds/06fc0188b59c862a098239912ec3b7be19a14eeb779e161a02a5d19e3d716c92.html\">افتح المثال</a></em></p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-html\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;group&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;group-has-[:focus]:font-bold&quot;</span>&gt;</span>Bold when any child has focus<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">input</span> /&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">input</span> /&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">input</span> /&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>&gt;</span>\n</code></pre>\n<p><strong>مجموعات مسمّاة</strong> للتعشيش:</p>\n<p><em>ميزات group المتقدمة — المثال 4 — <a href=\"https://stevekinney.com/generated/playgrounds/5ac273ced0b6215f6b854d039f26d17fbda8d7acbfa39a1ea0e854e881ef2c06.html\">افتح المثال</a></em></p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-html\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;group/outer&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;group/inner&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;group-hover/inner:text-blue-500 group-hover/outer:text-red-500&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n      Responds to specific parent\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>&gt;</span>\n</code></pre>\n<p><strong>محدِّدات عشوائية</strong>: <code>group-[.is-active]:bg-gray-100</code></p>\n<p><strong>قابلية التركيب في v4</strong>: ادمجها مع صيغ أخرى مثل <code>group-has-focus:not-disabled:opacity-100</code></p>\n<h3 id=\"نمط-الحاوية-الذكية\">نمط الحاوية الذكية</h3>\n<p>استخدم <code>group-has</code> لإنشاء مكوّنات واعية بالسياق:</p>\n<p><em>نمط الحاوية الذكية — المثال 5 — <a href=\"https://stevekinney.com/generated/playgrounds/f5a3db92f332d333376710a0aae3573f73992e3ee7a1de3e569b00d7ddd85566.html\">افتح المثال</a></em></p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-html\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- Navigation that changes theme when it contains an active link --&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">nav</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;group group-has-[.active]:bg-blue-50 group-has-[.active]:shadow-lg&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">a</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">href</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;#&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;group-hover:text-blue-200&quot;</span>&gt;</span>Home<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">a</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">a</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">href</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;#&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;active&quot;</span>&gt;</span>Products<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">a</span>&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">nav</span>&gt;</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- Form that styles based on validation state --&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">form</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;group group-has-[:invalid]:border-red-500 group-has-[:valid]:border-green-500&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">input</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">type</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;email&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">required</span> /&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;hidden text-red-600 group-has-[:invalid]:block&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n    Please fix errors before submitting\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">form</span>&gt;</span>\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"تنسيق-حالة-العنصر-الشقيق\">تنسيق حالة العنصر الشقيق</h2>\n<p>تتيح لك معدِّلات peer تنسيق العناصر بناءً على حالة العناصر الأشقاء. تضيف peer إلى عنصر واحد، ثم تستخدم <code>peer-hover:</code> و<code>peer-checked:</code> و<code>peer-focus:</code> وما شابه على الأشقاء الذين يأتون بعده في DOM.</p>\n<p>طبّق صنف <code>peer</code> على عنصر، ثم استخدم صيغ <code>peer-*</code> على الأشقاء اللاحقين:</p>\n<p><em>تنسيق حالة العنصر الشقيق — المثال 6 — <a href=\"https://stevekinney.com/generated/playgrounds/94a9cd1f1d5660fef0307331f911e0b90f826b16380a8475aa554f0ddc6a9176.html\">افتح المثال</a></em></p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-html\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;space-y-1&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;block peer-invalid:text-red-500&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">for</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;email&quot;</span>&gt;</span>Email<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">input</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">type</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;email&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">id</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;email&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;peer block rounded-sm outline-1&quot;</span> /&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;peer-invalid:text-red-500&quot;</span>&gt;</span>Please provide a valid email<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span>&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>&gt;</span>\n</code></pre>\n<p><strong>مهم:</strong> يعمل <code>peer</code> <em>فقط</em> على الأشقاء الذين يأتون بعد عنصر peer. هذا قيد في CSS.</p>\n<p>يعمل <code>peer</code> مع كل الأصناف الزائفة: <code>peer-focus</code> و<code>peer-required</code> و<code>peer-disabled</code>.</p>\n<h3 id=\"نمط-التسمية-العائمة\">نمط التسمية العائمة</h3>\n<p>مثالي لحقول النماذج الحديثة:</p>\n<p><em>نمط التسمية العائمة — المثال 7 — <a href=\"https://stevekinney.com/generated/playgrounds/25b9542e648e53eb60bbcc7e2d4784b5733815f80324963f8d247f7800908524.html\">افتح المثال</a></em></p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-html\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;relative&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">input</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;peer w-full rounded border px-3 pt-6 pb-2 placeholder-transparent focus:outline-none&quot;</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">placeholder</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;Enter your email&quot;</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">type</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;email&quot;</span>\n  /&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;absolute top-2 left-3 text-xs text-gray-500 transition-all peer-placeholder-shown:top-4 peer-placeholder-shown:text-base peer-focus:top-2 peer-focus:text-xs&quot;</span>\n  &gt;</span>\n    Email Address\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span>&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>&gt;</span>\n</code></pre>\n<h3 id=\"ميزات-peer-المتقدمة\">ميزات peer المتقدمة</h3>\n<p><strong>أقران مسمّون</strong> لعدة أشقاء:</p>\n<p><em>ميزات peer المتقدمة — المثال 8 — <a href=\"https://stevekinney.com/generated/playgrounds/aad1e123cea86b854aa061c5308b581976b40e89fc1ac964ef188f43a3eb76a9.html\">افتح المثال</a></em></p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-html\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">input</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">type</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;email&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;peer/email&quot;</span> /&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">input</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">type</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;password&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;peer/password&quot;</span> /&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;hidden peer-invalid/email:block&quot;</span>&gt;</span>Invalid email<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span>&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;hidden peer-invalid/password:block&quot;</span>&gt;</span>Invalid password<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span>&gt;</span>\n</code></pre>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>محدِّدات عشوائية</strong></p>\n<p>يمكنك استخدام <code>peer</code> مع <strong>محدِّدات عشوائية</strong>: <code>peer-[&amp;:nth-child(3)]:mt-4</code>.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"المزالق-الشائعة-وحلولها\">المزالق الشائعة وحلولها</h2>\n<h3 id=\"مشكلة-تعدد-الأقران\">مشكلة تعدد الأقران</h3>\n<p><em>مشكلة تعدد الأقران — المثال 9 — <a href=\"https://stevekinney.com/generated/playgrounds/39373328fd2446947047a974f56f375ecf2da2c2d9912c1878db9b74a36084e4.html\">افتح المثال</a></em></p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-html\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- ❌ Ambiguous - which peer responds? --&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">input</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;peer&quot;</span> /&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">input</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;peer&quot;</span> /&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;peer-focus:text-blue-600&quot;</span>&gt;</span>Confusing!<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span>&gt;</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- ✅ Clear with named peers --&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">input</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;peer/email&quot;</span> /&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">input</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;peer/password&quot;</span> /&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;peer-focus/email:text-blue-600&quot;</span>&gt;</span>Clear!<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span>&gt;</span>\n</code></pre>\n<h3 id=\"تعارضات-المجموعات-المتعششة\">تعارضات المجموعات المتعشّشة</h3>\n<p><em>تعارضات المجموعات المتعشّشة — المثال 10 — <a href=\"https://stevekinney.com/generated/playgrounds/ad78c8bf6477c09f41b4861932ef9f45ae64da5fdc8cd2112d2605c5997003f3.html\">افتح المثال</a></em></p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-html\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- ❌ Inner button responds to both groups --&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;group&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;group&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">button</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;group-hover:scale-110&quot;</span>&gt;</span>Unpredictable<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">button</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>&gt;</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- ✅ Named groups prevent conflicts --&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;group/outer&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;group/inner&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">button</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;group-hover/inner:scale-110&quot;</span>&gt;</span>Predictable<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">button</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>&gt;</span>\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"إظهار-المحتوى-المشروط\">إظهار المحتوى المشروط</h2>\n<p>أظهر المحتوى أو أخفه بناءً على اختيارات النموذج دون JavaScript بدمج <code>group</code> مع <code>has-*:</code> ليصبح <code>group-has-*:</code></p>\n<p><em>إظهار المحتوى المشروط — المثال 11 — <a href=\"https://stevekinney.com/generated/playgrounds/f945388370dbbf24224fde777e44364f69eb14d612648cb692ff07de77d06b92.html\">افتح المثال</a></em></p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-html\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;group rounded-lg border p-4&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">h3</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;font-semibold&quot;</span>&gt;</span>Feedback Survey<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">h3</span>&gt;</span>\n\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;mt-4 space-y-2&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;flex items-center gap-2&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">input</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">type</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;radio&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">name</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;rating&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">value</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;good&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;h-4 w-4&quot;</span> /&gt;</span>\n\n      <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">span</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;text-sm&quot;</span>&gt;</span>Good<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">span</span>&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span>&gt;</span>\n\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;flex items-center gap-2&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">input</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">type</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;radio&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">name</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;rating&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">value</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;poor&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;h-4 w-4&quot;</span> /&gt;</span>\n\n      <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">span</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;text-sm&quot;</span>&gt;</span>Poor<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">span</span>&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>&gt;</span>\n\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;mt-4 hidden rounded bg-yellow-50 p-3 group-has-[input[value=&#x27;poor&#x27;]:checked]:block&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;block text-sm font-medium&quot;</span>&gt;</span>What went wrong?<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span>&gt;</span>\n\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">textarea</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;mt-1 block w-full rounded border-2 border-yellow-300 bg-white px-3 py-2 text-sm focus:border-yellow-500 focus:outline-none&quot;</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">rows</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;2&quot;</span>\n    &gt;</span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">textarea</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>&gt;</span>\n</code></pre>\n<p>المحتوى المشروط:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>hidden</code>: المحتوى مخفي افتراضيًا</li>\n<li><code>has-[input[value='poor']:checked]:block</code>: يظهر عندما يُحدَّد زر اختيار معيّن</li>\n<li>يستهدف قيمًا محددة باستخدام محدِّدات الخصائص</li>\n</ul>\n<p>مثالي للنماذج المتفرعة وأنماط الكشف التدريجي.</p>\n<h2 id=\"الفروق-الأساسية\">الفروق الأساسية</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><code>group</code></strong>: من الأب → إلى السلائل (بأي عمق)</li>\n<li><strong><code>peer</code></strong>: من الشقيق → إلى الأشقاء اللاحقين فقط</li>\n<li><strong><code>group-has</code></strong>: يستجيب الأب لحالات السلائل</li>\n<li><strong>الصيغ المسمّاة</strong>: تمنع التعارضات في التخطيطات المعقدة</li>\n</ul>\n"}